# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) or set these in your deploy environment.
#
# Privacy-friendly, cookieless analytics (optional). Leave BOTH unset to keep
# analytics fully disabled — the app then never makes any tracking request.
# See src/analytics.ts for the privacy guarantees.

# Your Plausible site domain, e.g. "gymlog.app". Setting this enables analytics.
# VITE_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=

# Override the events endpoint only for a self-hosted Plausible/Umami instance.
# Defaults to https://plausible.io/api/event when unset.
# VITE_PLAUSIBLE_ENDPOINT=
